<title>USA: North Central CSD, Iowa won by Seattle-Northwest.</title>
<headline>North Central CSD, Iowa won by Seattle-Northwest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp. said it won $3.7 million of North Central Community School District, Iowa, general obligation school bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.4353 percent.</p>
</text>
